<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>怀孕2个月（5-8周）</title>
<script src="https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6"></script>
<script id="MathJax-script" async src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background: #eaf6fb;
    font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
  }
  .page {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 10px auto;
    background: #ffffff;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(150,200,220,0.15) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(150,200,220,0.15) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 20px 20px;
    border: 6px solid #a7d9ee;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 18px 20px 12px 20px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    color: #333;
  }
  .title {
    text-align: center;
    color: #17a6d6;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin: 4px 0 14px 0;
    text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #cceaf5;
  }
  .highlight-box {
    background: #fff3cc;
    color: #e69a00;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 15px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 12px 0 6px 0;
  }
  .section-header .icon {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-right: 6px;
  }
  .section-header .label {
    color: #17a6d6;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 16px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #17a6d6;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .body-text {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 4px 0 10px 0;
    color: #333;
  }
  table.schedule {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  table.schedule td {
    border: 1px solid #bfe4f2;
    padding: 8px 6px;
    vertical-align: middle;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  table.schedule td.week-label {
    background: #cdeef8;
    color: #17a6d6;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    width: 60px;
  }
  table.schedule td.recommend-label {
    background: #17a6d6;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    width: 60px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <div class="title">怀孕2个月（5-8周）</div>

    <div class="highlight-box">
      主补营养素：维生素C、维生素B6，缓解牙龈出血、抑制妊娠呕吐
    </div>

    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="icon">🌿</span>
      <span class="label">维生素C的来源：</span>
    </div>
    <div class="body-text">
      新鲜的水果蔬菜，比如，青椒、菜花、白菜、蕃茄、黄瓜、菠菜、柠檬、草莓、苹果等。
    </div>

    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="icon">🍯</span>
      <span class="label">维生素VB6的来源：</span>
    </div>
    <div class="body-text">
      在麦芽糖中含量最高，每天可以吃1—2勺麦芽糖。
    </div>

    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="icon">🥩</span>
      <span class="label">富含维生素B6的来源：</span>
    </div>
    <div class="body-text">
      植物性食品：香蕉，马铃薯，黄豆，胡萝卜，核桃，花生，菠菜等。<br>
      动物性食品：瘦肉，鸡肉，鸡蛋，鱼等含量较多。
    </div>

    <table class="schedule">
      <tr>
        <td class="week-label">第5周</td>
        <td>饮食同第四周相同。</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="week-label">第6周</td>
        <td>孕妇要多食海带，其它食物自便。这是为胎儿大脑发育着想。</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="week-label">第7周</td>
        <td>大量食米及豆类，尤其是豆腐，为胎儿的肉质发育做准备。</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="week-label">第8周</td>
        <td>饮食与第四周一致。</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="recommend-label">推荐<br>食谱</td>
        <td>鲤鱼鸡蛋汤、凉拌猪肝、麻酱菠菜、草莓绿豆粥、烧素什锦、什锦果汁饭、芹菜炒香干、糖醋白菜、醋溜土豆丝、糖醋萝卜皮</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
